{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06750","headline":"东京府县诸公与綦毋潜李颀相送至白马寺宿 · 王昌龄","name":"东京府县诸公与綦毋潜李颀相送至白马寺宿","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"鞍马上东门，裴回入孤舟。\n贤豪相追送，即櫂千里流。\n赤岸落日在，空波微烟收。\n薄宦忘机括，醉来即淹留。\n月明见古寺，林外登高楼。\n南风开长廊，夏夜如凉秋。\n江月照吴县，西归梦中游。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王昌龄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06750.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06750","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}